Z||000000||MODIFIE||06-25-2001||02:44 AM||||How much horsepower can be gain with a Dry Sump Oil Pan||||reg||5
Z||000001||Will||06-25-2001||12:16 PM||||None.<BR>A dry sump oil system has more parasitic loss than a wet sump system (running 3-4 pumps instead of 1).<P>You only need a dry sump system if you are sustaining lateral G loads such that you are starving the engine of oil. Most Fieros can't do that unless they have VERY tricked out suspensions.||||reg||1
